        "code": {
          "text": "Back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing for approximately 10 days; dull mid-lumbar ache rated 4–5/10. Worse after long shifts stacking boxes and better with rest and a heat pack. Patient wonders if it may be related to a new mattress or twisting while loading a truck. No trauma, fall, or single heavy lift."
      }
